{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "587b5a33a52f028f00041ec3a293ccc2af3ca76e59dc3f5552d1310fcee09a69", "ja": "オファーは突然カルダモン！？", "zh": "邀约总是突如其来豆蔻香！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "078cf24bab264e9342c6c36fea3525980516f1ee6ed43145579843a5930a887a", "ja": "杏奈のもとに突然、ゲーミングカレーという\n商品開発企画が舞い込む。CM、新曲と大忙\nしな杏奈のため、可奈と莉緒もユニットとし\nて参加し、協力する事に。", "zh": "望月杏奈身边突然出现了名为“游戏咖喱”的\n商品开发企划。为了帮助忙于拍摄广告、制作新\n曲的杏奈，可奈和莉绪也决定以组合的形式参加，\n协助她完成企划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "17d8e13ca0784e66120d8c5fe7cd365dbf60b57076aafdb3013addf0063de5e9", "ja": "（さて、杏奈に『ゲーミングカレー』の企画の\n相談をしたいんだけど……どこにいるかな？）", "zh": "（那么，我想找杏奈商量一下‘游戏咖喱’的企划……她现在在哪儿呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "8643a4f8b9d4157bc64a95061384032ef92487964557ef157cbca33d3523cde0", "ja": "ふふふっふ～ん♪　えっへっへ～♪", "zh": "呵呵呵哼～♪　嘿嘿嘿～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "113b9bc3cdeca5c7e883c09cab10376c2ba7095fe8441a07f77ba5530db0e2f7", "ja": "あら？　可奈ちゃん。\nなんだかご機嫌みたいね。いい事でもあったの？", "zh": "咦？是可奈呀。\n感觉你心情很好呢。是遇到什么好事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "90751a9487fbe36318f706dbfab6fc3f1e96c6d39fb5ee5593264f27a66badca", "ja": "そうなんです！　聞いてください、莉緒さん！\n今日の晩ご飯……カレーなんです！", "zh": "就是嘛！莉绪姐，您听我说！今天的晚饭……是咖喱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1004_036kan", "source_sha256": "e042beae54f21800374146a07b78ce9971851ee9c55a00cdac9f38dfb4ffed07", "ja": "私、朝からずっと楽しみで……！\nカレーの日って、なんだかワクワクしませんか？", "zh": "我从早上就一直很期待……！\n咖喱日什么的，不觉得特别让人心跳加速吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "39fd3b5689bb20769814359f950c622a296694d09dc19641b8b123d974c1307d", "ja": "なるほど、わかるわ～！\n実家にいた時、カレーの匂いがすると嬉しかったもの。", "zh": "原来如此，我懂～！\n以前住在家里的时候，一闻到咖喱的香味就会很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "3a4af8eb6feda442b4837c7d4a27975c9ae1746b2745f5c7dd25c972d4bd713e", "ja": "ですよね！　ビーフかな～♪　チキンかな～♪\nねえねえ、杏奈ちゃんはどんなカレーが好き？", "zh": "对吧！是牛肉咖喱吗～♪还是鸡肉咖喱呢～♪\n呐呐，杏奈喜欢什么样的咖喱？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "9e8141e61e473969f8fc18a154cac2e8399e05799cd9e2f22e3ff76921986c7d", "ja": "杏奈も、おうちのカレー……好き♪\nでも、レトルトも……簡単にできるし、好きだよ♪", "zh": "杏奈也喜欢家里的咖喱……♪\n不过，袋装咖喱做起来也很简单，所以也喜欢哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "95f3bde6fbb3b531954ef0c6e5fa010c98f91df70b72fd72afc3c6ce3951d456", "ja": "そうそう。最近のレトルトカレー、\nすごいわよね～。お店のかと思っちゃうくらい。", "zh": "对对。最近的即食咖喱，\n真的很厉害呢～简直让人以为是店里做的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1009_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "3df6fd69ce2eb6752c51a77e65aa4e17fd8449203daed966cefc3fd96b122a71", "ja": "杏奈、ここにいたのか。可奈と莉緒もお疲れさま。\n……なんかカレーって言葉が聞こえたような？", "zh": "杏奈，原来你在这里。可奈、莉绪也辛苦了。\n……我好像听到了“咖喱”这个词？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "c07539d532b141badb347ac86e49ee863439e95e40b91415b956554faf37e04a", "ja": "そうなの♪　ちょっとカレーの話に花が咲いちゃって。\n{$P$}くんも一緒にどう？", "zh": "就是呀♪刚才聊咖喱聊得起劲了。\n{$P$}君也一起来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e1a1117c4e032c8dffcc8e7c85a5c9be6bd0212d37a6f170537df19f0d1f6588", "ja": "それじゃ、ちょうどいいから聞かせてもらうかな。\nどんな話をしてたんだ？", "zh": "那正好，我就来听听吧。\n你们刚才在聊什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "b5656ab6d8fa92a203b0e549ec8462bcf48e4956d2981225699986480a5f4ab0", "ja": "えっと……「レトルトのカレーもおいしいね！」\nって話をしてました！　そうだよね、杏奈ちゃん♪", "zh": "那个……我们刚才在说“即食咖喱也很好吃呢！”！\n对吧，杏奈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "18d2b0003c1444ffd58c51e11e49ecdc5450abe227739ef5e7792e3f6fb6e472", "ja": "うん……♪　杏奈、ゲームしてると……\nいつもご飯食べるの、忘れちゃうから……。", "zh": "嗯……♪杏奈玩游戏的时候……\n总是会忘记吃饭……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "a5c51282ecf3ae04700f9bac3eb647cb6d93e3e2722a405211253c5cc6115052", "ja": "レトルトは、楽ちんだから……よく食べる、よ。\n新商品を、食べ比べたり……してます。", "zh": "速食食品很方便……所以经常吃。\n还会把新品拿来比较着吃……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0dc23c3af6601f74428d34aa555dfdfc50c872b86a28c55dc24828d5590bb6cb", "ja": "ん？　なあ、杏奈。もしかしてその話、\nゲーム誌のコラムに書いたことあるか？", "zh": "嗯？那个，杏奈。难道这件事，\n你之前在游戏杂志的专栏里写过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "1779550058f5a0520f1eb9b92efa5d3338ef260f0899a13e8f09046f60a1e62f", "ja": "うん……たまに、書く……よ？\nおいしいの見つけたら……オススメって……。", "zh": "嗯……偶尔会写……哦？\n要是发现好吃的……就会写推荐……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "89499506845210bb513a15ec944676e4becc9a966a5285a397e8dedc5d7dc2e6", "ja": "なるほど、そういうことか……。\nなんとなく話がつながったな。", "zh": "原来如此，是这么回事啊……\n不知不觉间，事情就联系起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "7eff52d068db769d05c18ee975bc3831ad14f2c32f80f1836565ab38a48fe1f0", "ja": "？？　えっと……{$P$}さん？\nつながったって……どういう、こと……？", "zh": "？？呃……{$P$}先生？\n你说联系上了……是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "f14b7894cdcdd780d18a88ec78f476ef71a9ae02b4441c0c96b69f6e98d13edd", "ja": "ああ、これから話そうと思ってたんだ。\n実は杏奈に、仕事の話が来てるんだ。内容は……。", "zh": "啊，我正想接着说来着。\n其实杏奈接到了工作邀请。内容是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1021_024ann", "source_sha256": "bd855f8013a76fbc54c7dafedb32fcb2caa4fd44430907de6ee18fe32b2e8301", "ja": "ゲーミング、カレー……。", "zh": "电竞咖喱……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1022_036kan", "source_sha256": "142d1745b05f5d1978e9d7acf2684cbd4384cb03f7f6b1d6eec57f276541fd49", "ja": "ゲーミングカレー？", "zh": "电竞咖喱？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1023_046rio", "source_sha256": "142d1745b05f5d1978e9d7acf2684cbd4384cb03f7f6b1d6eec57f276541fd49", "ja": "ゲーミングカレー？", "zh": "电竞咖喱？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "4027bcfadae8f33edd8a90d32baeefc41ed58c7fa9fb3adfcd7df92645dcdfd6", "ja": "ゲームなのに、カレーですか？\nゲーム機を煮込む……なんてことはないですよね？", "zh": "明明是游戏，居然是咖喱吗？\n不会要把游戏机拿去炖……之类的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1025_p", "source_sha256": "29f2a68d593670e18f851f522a99789402b2cb815e204b01d914e9cba7222668", "ja": "企画書によると、『ゲームで遊ぶ人のことを考えた\nカレー』を作りたいみたいだ。", "zh": "根据企划书，好像是想做出“为玩游戏的人考虑的咖喱”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1027_046rio", "source_sha256": "d3fd99173e55056a15ddadf24e5e254b2fbc80f9a51e490ca5fbe1f6656fc8f0", "ja": "なるほど。杏奈ちゃんもさっき手軽だって言ってたし、\nゲームとカレーって、相性がいいのかも。", "zh": "原来如此。杏奈刚才也说这样很方便，游戏和咖喱，说不定很搭呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "ab8eaba8bed035ede19dca048e01e8a5aa50efd629ce03b7d8ff0b0acb5eed1e", "ja": "とにかく、まずは杏奈の意見を聞いてから、\n返事をしようと思って。どうだ、杏奈？", "zh": "总之，我想先听听杏奈的意见，再做答复。杏奈，你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1029_024ann", "source_sha256": "b1cf222cbab19cdf7f745543ece443739dc29d1043bacaf7eadce22571ac05dd", "ja": "杏奈……やってみたい。", "zh": "杏奈……想试试看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1030_024ann", "source_sha256": "bf45b3b18c3a8906e5430a2c2b4fc7020dbdc67a03e11b64e1f8268720d60864", "ja": "杏奈の、コラムが……他のお仕事になって……\nビックリ……。でも、すごくうれしい……♪", "zh": "杏奈的专栏……变成其他工作了……  \n好惊讶……不过，真的好开心……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1031_024ann", "source_sha256": "78d0043b6f32c4ee9571af00f74a351b4cc75c5b37eeba80f20ba1c239dd7a37", "ja": "それに……ゲーミングカレー、ちょっと面白そう……。\n杏奈が作って、いいんだよね……？", "zh": "而且……游戏咖喱，感觉也挺有意思的……\n让杏奈来做，没问题吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "3e1234a755a7d810b25ea2113b3a5f4f4f92a99dada0f85a12e4be46d8b55a37", "ja": "もちろん。\n杏奈の希望を詰め込んだカレーを作ってくれ！", "zh": "当然了。\n去做出填满杏奈心愿的咖喱吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1033_p", "source_sha256": "cb6a6fcf9b370b6fc7a113309d1e3259dac618164ffd71c6628f6b862ecc6fc4", "ja": "あと企画と合わせて、CMと新曲の制作も決まってる。\n新曲は公演で披露する予定だから、忙しくなるぞ！", "zh": "另外配合这次企划，也已经定下了广告和新歌的制作。\n新歌预定在演出中进行披露，接下来可会忙起来了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1034_036kan", "source_sha256": "811c824c7a1fa3d4c5ba4d532a2f6a350ba03008665578c5510a60a9497c6249", "ja": "わあ、杏奈ちゃんすごいね！\n新しい曲まで歌えちゃうなんて！", "zh": "哇，杏奈好厉害呀！\n居然还能唱新歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1035_046rio", "source_sha256": "4b50eb5e0387a014d86187dd065ec3581f497cd217f120001305d5eef3c9f3e6", "ja": "でも、カレー作りに新曲のレッスン……\nそれにCM撮影もでしょ？　杏奈ちゃん、大丈夫？", "zh": "不过，做咖喱、练习新歌……\n而且还要拍广告，对吧？杏奈，没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1036_024ann", "source_sha256": "b542b6c2811751f61d1fc1057dcfefe98d9c113be48abae5d16d94bae3f3638f", "ja": "た、確かにちょっと……大変、かも……？", "zh": "确、确实有点……辛苦，可能……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1037_p", "source_sha256": "a4ecdbe736bf5f1cd20d6b9b1b4257f820ac3e6f1f97267eea17c3f2e858cd25", "ja": "ああ。だからユニットでいこうと思ってるんだ。\n仲間がいれば、あらゆる面でカバーしあえるからな。", "zh": "啊。所以我打算组队参加。\n有伙伴的话，各方面都能互相弥补。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1038_p", "source_sha256": "6e8ee2e011b570291c73d4cab7901a3bd8e6acd2fbca0f553e5612a3f92c5b5a", "ja": "そこで……可奈！　莉緒！\n杏奈と一緒にユニットをやってみないか？", "zh": "所以……可奈！莉绪！要不要和杏奈一起组个组合试试？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1039_036kan", "source_sha256": "50d42c48451dc151a05ece132939d556a3d9065ebd4adea7559f4ff4c2b4dce9", "ja": "わーい！　カレーのユニット、やってみたいです！\nカレーのお仕事～♪　煮込めばコトコト～♪　えへっ！", "zh": "哇——！我想做咖喱组合！\n咖喱的工作～♪咕嘟咕嘟炖煮中～♪诶嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1040_046rio", "source_sha256": "ebd9e53a3c1b7fea51136e53caf0180f08348108edfe8e74dc5993ad5f62a6fa", "ja": "ユニットはやってみたいけど……\nカレーの歌なのよね？　うーん……。", "zh": "虽然想试试看组成组合……\n可这是唱咖喱的歌吧？嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1041_p", "source_sha256": "2a803ea0df63f97ffc957c450beebd829cc69c3c56ac1c460fe5ac6624ee3a47", "ja": "なんだ莉緒。迷ってるのか？", "zh": "怎么了，莉绪。你在犹豫吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1042_046rio", "source_sha256": "ee4670c699626218515ce9b69f8e7a26e46dd711b2b36743e48bf0b9c6e26f0c", "ja": "ちょっとね……。だって、カレーにセクシーって、\nなんだか付け合せとしてどうなのかな、って……。", "zh": "有点……毕竟，说到咖喱配性感，总觉得这搭配是不是有点不太对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1043_036kan", "source_sha256": "19a66e9633922d823f9f25d47bafcfc657917097decb5e793280582a2490da7d", "ja": "カレーと相性の悪い人なんていませんよ！\n莉緒さんはスパイス～♪　絶対にいてほしいッス～♪", "zh": "没有人会和咖喱合不来吧！\n莉绪姐就是香料～♪ 绝对希望你在身边啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1044_024ann", "source_sha256": "37b03c47ff788e0fa8bff4bb0fbe35c107d644580c5e061f20085788c5d0df17", "ja": "杏奈も……莉緒さんと一緒が、いいです……。\nスパイスは……味を決める、重要な役……。", "zh": "杏奈也……想和莉绪姐一起……。\n香料是……决定味道的重要角色……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1045_046rio", "source_sha256": "8df5aa49bff74928e534f4bca7cd95faf59370fd6d1df10e70c78900b340198c", "ja": "私が、スパイス……？　重要な役……。\nそ、そうなのかしら？　ウフフ♪", "zh": "我……是香料……？是重要的角色……。\n这、这样吗？　呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1046_p", "source_sha256": "77a760eabc9b07d03822e415201d263e3ca0d9b1a8a1fc8241e02f36cc313666", "ja": "そうだな。杏奈と可奈に足りないものを、\n莉緒が補ってくれたらって思うよ。", "zh": "是啊。我希望莉绪能补足杏奈和可奈所欠缺的东西。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1047_046rio", "source_sha256": "7695307443cd3675a2898d275c5a355e8c005a7e6a179511bf6c5c3d7bd29570", "ja": "そう……うん、分かったわ！　私も参加する！\nお姉さんが、刺激的なセクシーを担当してあげるわね♪", "zh": "这样……嗯，我明白了！我也参加！姐姐我就来负责刺激又性感的部分吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0162_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0162_story_01_1048_p", "source_sha256": "146c4ba94a24cac945445eee8540dc5ed410dfb2d847af93bccc5db7fe980aa3", "ja": "（ユニットも決まった、カレーの企画も開始だ！\n忙しくなってきたけど、みんなと乗り切るぞ！）", "zh": "（组合定下来了，咖喱企划也开始了！虽然越来越忙，但要和大家一起努力撑过去！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
